/-! ### Weyl + Ricci decomposition of the frame curvature -/

/-- `R_{IJAB} = C_{IJAB} + ½(η_{IA}R_{JB} − η_{IB}R_{JA} − η_{JA}R_{IB} + η_{JB}R_{IA}) − (R/6)(η_{IA}η_{JB} − η_{IB}η_{JA})`. -/
theorem riemFL_decomp (hN : NullFrameData g gi E Θ U) {x : Pt 4} (hx : x ∈ U) (I J A B : Fin 4) :
    riemFL g gi E Θ I J A B x = weylF g gi E I J A B x
